  "summary_text": "Dependency upgrade and webhook handler and load test\nNotes on dependency upgrade added to the doc\nDependency upgrade and connection pool seen as one underlying problem\nNo clear owner for webhook handler\nNotes on load test added to the doc\nPreference to set up a short sync rather than check with legal\nSlack thread and timeline and tracing setup\nConcern with slack thread: that it just sits there\nTimeline is mostly fine\nSuggestion to do it properly before touching tracing setup\nPreference to document the decision rather than go back to the original plan\nProgress updates\nDone: document the new event schema (Kofi)\nDone: ship the new pricing page (Megan)\nSlipped: fix the double-charge retry bug (Sam, now due Wednesday)\nNext steps\nTomás to set up the Falcon staging database by Friday\nRuth to write the regression suite for checkout by Thursday\nMegan to implement the three-step onboarding flow by Wednesday",
  "summary_markdown": "### Dependency upgrade and webhook handler and load test\n- Notes on dependency upgrade added to the doc\n  - Dependency upgrade and connection pool seen as one underlying problem\n- No clear owner for webhook handler\n- Notes on load test added to the doc\n- Preference to set up a short sync rather than check with legal\n\n### Slack thread and timeline and tracing setup\n- Concern with slack thread: that it just sits there\n- Timeline is mostly fine\n- Suggestion to do it properly before touching tracing setup\n- Preference to document the decision rather than go back to the original plan\n\n### Progress updates\n- **Done:** document the new event schema (Kofi)\n- **Done:** ship the new pricing page (Megan)\n- **Slipped:** fix the double-charge retry bug (Sam, now due Wednesday)\n\n### Next steps\n- Tomás to set up the Falcon staging database by **Friday**\n- Ruth to write the regression suite for checkout by **Thursday**\n- Megan to implement the three-step onboarding flow by **Wednesday**",
