    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Tomás Herrera"
      },
      "text": "I'd rather document the decision than go back to the original plan, I don't know. So yeah, I'm not convinced the monorepo tooling is pretty close, to be honest. For this specifically, the backfill job is better than last week",
